    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer proudly offers for sale this lovely four bedroom detached property situated in a beautiful rural location just 5 minutes from Carrigaline. \r\n\r\nThe property sits on a magnificent c.0.75 acres site that offers spectacular views of the surrounding countryside and right out to the coastline and Old Head of Kinsale at a distance. It has the benefit of having the perfect direct south facing orientation and enjoys the most peaceful and secure setting for raising a young family. \r\n\r\nThe property offers well appointed accommodation over two floors, there is huge potential to extend further if required and has an outside garden room ideal for those working from home. While the property has been well cared for as a family, it does require some modernization and upgrading for the next owner offering endless potential to create the perfect family home in a hugely popular and sought after rural location. \r\n\r\nJust minutes’ drive from all amenities and services in Carrigaline, it is also just a short commute to Kinsale, Cork city, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy. \r\n\r\nViewing of this beautiful property comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 4.51m x 2.11m \r\nPVC front door with glazing, tile floor, carpet stairway, centre light.\r\n\r\nSplit Level Open Plan Kitchen/Dining - 7.27m x 4.55m \r\nVinyl/laminate flooring, extensive fitted kitchen unit with integrated oven, grill, electric hob, overhead stainless-steel extractor unit, dishwasher, tile splashback, large windows and doors allowing ample natural light and delightful views of the surrounding countryside\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 3.58m x 1.76m \r\nTile floor, fitted units, plumbed for washing machine and dryer, side door, centre light. \r\n\r\nGuest WC - 1.76m x 0.84m \r\nWC, WHB, centre light. \r\n\r\nLiving Room - 3.79m x 4.53m \r\nWooden floor, large bay window, inserted solid fuel stove, decretive wallpaper and corning, centre light. \r\n\r\nDownstairs Bedroom/Study - 3.55m x 3.02m \r\nSemi-solid wooden floor, centre light. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - 5.06m x 2.42m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, stira stairs to overhead attic. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.27m x 4.24m \r\nWooden floor, spotlights. \r\n\r\nWalk-in Wardrobe - 1.21m x 1.5m \r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.39m x 2.8m \r\nCarpet floor, large velux window, centre light, built-in bunk bed unit. \r\n\r\nEn Suite - 1.26m x 1.96m \r\nVinyl floor, WC, WHB, electric shower unit. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.49m x 3.14m \r\nCarpet floor, centre light, curtain pole, curtains, walk-in wardrobe unit. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.91m x 2.84m \r\nVinyl floor, large velux window, centre light, WC, WHB, bath unit with tile surround. \r\n\r\nSELF CONTAINED CABIN - \r\n\r\n\r\nRoom 1 - 5.21m x 3.71m \r\nCarpet floor, centre fluorescent lighting. \r\n\r\nRoom 2 - 3.58m x 3.7m \r\nLaminate floor, centre light. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 150.8 sq metres (1,621 sq ft)\r\nPVC Double Glazed Windows & Doors\r\nBeautiful 0.75 acre site with south facing rear garden\r\nPanoramic views of the surrounding countryside \r\nSpacious living & bedroom accommodation\r\nGood decorative order throughout\r\nShort drive to all amenities & services in Carrigaline.\r\nShort commute to Cork City, Cork Airport & Ringaskiddy"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Carrigaline, continue straight through the main street and follow the road around to the right, past ‘The Corner House’. Continue on the Lower Kilmoney road for about 5 minutes’ until you come to a cross roads. Take the right turn at the cross road and continue along this road for approx 700/800 metres. The property is situated on the left hand side, indicated by our ‘For Sale’ Sign. Follow Eircode: P17 P229"
      }
